### Memory Bank Rules

- **Check First**: Always reference active context before starting work
- **Update Progress**: Keep activeContext updated with progress
- **Log Solutions**: Add solutions to troubleshooting when fixing bugs
- **Never Commit**: Don't include memory bank files in git commits

